From: zortos293 <65777760+zortos293@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Ocarina of Time: fog and exposure visual workaround

Port of Orchid 3fcd393b7 by zortos293. Scales the fog slice distance by 0.25
in compute 780c0536b89fc89e and the exposure constant by 0.65 in fragment
bded5ce917183214, for title 0400486024DEC000 only. Not an emulator fix.

This core has no program_id in the pipeline cache, so the title comes from
LoadDiskResources alone. Hashes are compared without their lowest bit, so the
edits survive a change of the native hash salt. Switch: EDEN_NX2_OOT_VISUAL_WORKAROUND=1 turns it on
here; 0101 changes the default.
